{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分屏幕的感受词堆叠过密、近义重复，叙事因果和前后衔接不如Y自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的关键词放大加亮，主线可以先扫出来，感受文字又能在音乐对应的小节补充音色、力度、停顿和情绪回落等细节，作为边听边看的观众，更容易同时抓住故事和音乐。Y的叙述更连贯，人物为什么这样想、前后情绪如何转变交代得更自然，但长句需要连续阅读，而且压缩掉了一些具体的音乐变化。总体我选X，不过它需要控制部分感受词的堆叠，否则细腻容易变成信息拥挤。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "99413bf8-cdad-4b08-9df5-f38157a5b6e5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T181500663865Z", "elapsed_seconds": 177.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:17:57.756929+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8391362f67ab03d116e4e35848b1172ea672e957c3c2075079a17d4ff24f5b09", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf